{
  "title": "nutty dense ethiopian turkey neck en-croute",
  "description": "energizing dish featuring turkey neck, en-croute, and a blend of spices, great for a satisfying meal. traditionally served with a side of injera.",
  "cuisine": "ethiopian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
